  "caption": {
    "en": "Price reaches a demand zone (setup), a bullish engulfing candle forms (confirmation), and the buy triggers when price passes that candle's high.",
    "bn": "দাম demand zone-এ পৌঁছায় (setup), bullish engulfing candle তৈরি হয় (confirmation), ওই candle-এর high পেরোলে buy (trigger)।"
  },
  "notes": {
    "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
    "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "en": "Three separate steps: where, what, when. Each one answers a different question.",
    "bn": "তিনটি আলাদা ধাপ: কোথায়, কী, কখন। প্রতিটি আলাদা প্রশ্নের উত্তর।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "Confirmation says the idea is alive. Trigger says act now",
      "bn": "Confirmation বলে idea জীবিত, trigger বলে এখনই নিন"
    }
  ],
